  "approved_decision": "Accept that this programme requires eligible 5K evidence at each new 5K-targeted start. Athletes may replace their input with a genuinely completed, representative sustained 5K, then explicitly confirm, review and accept the resulting targets. If eligible evidence is unavailable, affected starts remain unavailable. Preserve the 56-day rule, existing threshold-only manual alternative and frozen started sessions. Add no test or fallback.",
